---
title: Lantern glazed roots
servings: 4
---

= Glaze

Warm @olive oil{2%tbsp} in a #pan{} and soften @garlic{2%cloves}(minced) with @Garlic{1%clove}(minced; for the sauce) until golden. -- the second clove goes in late
Whisk in @balsamic vinegar{2%tbsp} and a splash of @balsamic vinegar{}, then season with @salt and @pepper.

= Roots

Toss @carrots{3} and @?garlic{3}(peeled) in the glaze, [- the roots can
sit overnight -] then roast for ~{40%minutes}.
Finish with @evoo{1%tbsp} and @moonberry jam{1%jar} if you have it.
